AB  - A new type of sleep disorder treatment system based on transcranial microcurrent stimulation has been developed, Which consumes less power. Main technical indexes: the stimulation frequency of 0.5 Hz, 1.5Hz and 100Hz which can be adjusted by the two-phase constant current stimulation, the stimulation current 0–1mA which can be adjusted continuously, and the stimulation pulse width of 50∼1000ms which can be adjusted continuously. The effectiveness of using the system to treat sleep disorder has been confirmed in clinical application. This kind of treatment can avoid side effects caused by drug treatment of insomnia, and the statistical result shows that the effective rate of this system for insomnia treatment is 91.24%.
