AB  - The early and accurate detection of stress- and tension-induced seizures stays a huge assignment in neurological healthcare. This examine proposes a machine gaining knowledge of framework making use of a Random Forest classifier for classifying seizures primarily based on manually extracted EEG features. The version, skilled on an augmented seizure dataset, accomplished a check accuracy of a 100%, demonstrating super capability in distinguishing among stress-primarily based and anxiety-primarily based seizure patterns. The machine lets in real-time prediction thru consumer-input EEG characteristic vectors and provides immediate category comments. Extensive assessment confirms the model's robustness, sensitivity, and specificity, highlighting its suitability for fast medical screening. Although based totally on a conventional device learning method, the model's high accuracy and computational performance pro-vide a promising basis for transportable and embedded seizure detection structures. Future paintings will consciousness on increasing the dataset range, integrating deep gaining knowledge of architectures like PSO-LSTM, and deploying the device for actual-time, ambulatory monitoring packages to enhance affected person effects and diagnostic precision.
