AV  - Department of Anaesthesiology, Waikato Clinical School, University of Auckland Hamilton, New Zealand.; Department of Mechanical Engineering and Center for Neural Engineering and Prostheses, University of California Berkeley, CA, USA.; Department of Mechanical Engineering and Center for Neural Engineering and Prostheses, University of California Berkeley, CA, USA.; Department of Anesthesiology, Atlanta VA Medical Center/Emory University Atlanta, GA, USA.; Department of Anaesthesiology, Waikato Clinical School, University of Auckland Hamilton, New Zealand.; Department of Anaesthesiology, Waikato Clinical School, University of Auckland Hamilton, New Zealand.
UR  - https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25165436/
LA  - eng
