AV  - Department of Anaesthesiology and Critical Care Medicine, General Hospital Innichen, Freisingstrasse 2, I-39038 Innichen, Italy. rosmarie.oberhammer@sb-bruneck.it
UR  - https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17988783/
