AV  - Department of Neurological Surgery, University of Washington, Seattle, USA; Neurosurgery, Mater Dei Hospital, Belo Horizonte, Brazil. Electronic address: vilelamd@gmail.com.; Neurosurgery, Mater Dei Hospital, Belo Horizonte, Brazil.; Anesthesiology, Mater Dei Hospital, Belo Horizonte, Brazil.; Anesthesiology, Mater Dei Hospital, Belo Horizonte, Brazil.
