UR  - http://sfx.mpg.de/sfx_local?sid=OVID:psycdb&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.1016%2Fj.jad.2024.01.205&issn=0165-0327&isbn=&volume=351&issue=&spage=15&pages=15-23&date=2024&title=Journal+of+Affective+Disorders&atitle=Cognitive+protection+and+brain+entropy+changes+from+omega-3+polyunsaturated+fatty+acids+supplement+in+late-life+depression%3A+A+52-week+randomized+controlled+trial.&aulast=Lin&pid=%3Cauthor%3ELin%2C+Chemin%3BLee%2C+Shwu-Hua%3BHuang%2C+Chih-Mao%3BWu%2C+Yu-Wen%3BChang%2C+You-Xun%3BLiu%2C+Ho-Ling%3BNg%2C+Shu-Hang%3BCheng%2C+Ying-Chih%3BChiu%2C+Chih-Chiang%3BWu%2C+Shun-Chi%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2024-58861-004%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EJournal+Article%3C%2FDT%3E
LA  - English     PT  - Journal, Peer Reviewed Journal
