CY  - ["Sharma, Manish: Department of Electrical Engineering, Institute of Infrastructure, Technology, Research and Management (IITRAM), Ahmedabad, India, manishsharma.iitb@gmail.com", "Sharma, Manish: manishsharma.iitb@gmail.com"] United Kingdom
