UR  - http://sfx.mpg.de/sfx_local?sid=OVID:psycdb&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=0419-4217&isbn=9798381167917&volume=85&issue=6-B&spage=No&pages=No+Pagination+Specified&date=2024&title=Dissertation+Abstracts+International%3A+Section+B%3A+The+Sciences+and+Engineering&atitle=Perturbing+the+edge+of+consciousness+examining+signatures+of+criticality+in+the+conscious+and+unconscious+brain.&aulast=DallaVecchia&pid=%3Cauthor%3EDallaVecchia%2C+Alessandra%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2024-49613-055%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EDissertation%3C%2FDT%3E
