UR  - http://sfx.mpg.de/sfx_local?sid=OVID:psycdb&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.1016%2Fj.cortex.2022.05.014&issn=0010-9452&isbn=&volume=154&issue=&spage=89&pages=89-104&date=2022&title=Cortex%3A+A+Journal+Devoted+to+the+Study+of+the+Nervous+System+and+Behavior&atitle=Resting-state+network+organisation+in+children+with+traumatic+brain+injury.&aulast=Botchway&pid=%3Cauthor%3EBotchway%2C+Edith%3BKooper%2C+Cece+C%3BPouwels%2C+Petra+J.+W%3BBruining%2C+Hilgo%3BEngelen%2C+Marc%3BOosterlaan%2C+Jaap%3BKonigs%2C+Marsh%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2022-95463-008%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EJournal+Article%3C%2FDT%3E
