TI  - Relationship between cortical acetylcholine, neurophysiologic complexity, and the level of consciousness.
Y1  - 2022
T2  - Dissertation Abstracts International: Section B: The Sciences and Engineering
SN  - ["0419-4217", "979-8780609803"]
