UR  - http://sfx.mpg.de/sfx_local?sid=OVID:psycdb&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=0419-4217&isbn=9798780609803&volume=83&issue=9-B&spage=No&pages=No+Pagination+Specified&date=2022&title=Dissertation+Abstracts+International%3A+Section+B%3A+The+Sciences+and+Engineering&atitle=Relationship+between+cortical+acetylcholine%2C+neurophysiologic+complexity%2C+and+the+level+of+consciousness.&aulast=Brito&pid=%3Cauthor%3EBrito%2C+Michael%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2022-56510-066%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EDissertation%3C%2FDT%3E
