UR  - http://sfx.mpg.de/sfx_local?sid=OVID:psycdb&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.1007%2Fs12671-020-01487-3&issn=1868-8527&isbn=&volume=11&issue=12&spage=2695&pages=2695-2704&date=2020&title=Mindfulness&atitle=Mindfulness+training+is+associated+with+changes+in+alpha-theta+cross-frequency+dynamics+during+meditation.&aulast=Rodriguez-Larios&pid=%3Cauthor%3ERodriguez-Larios%2C+Julio%3BWong%2C+Kian+Foong%3BLim%2C+Julian%3BAlaerts%2C+Kaat%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2020-63990-001%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EJournal+Article%3C%2FDT%3E
