UR  - http://sfx.mpg.de/sfx_local?sid=OVID:psycdb&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.1002%2Fch.386&issn=0960-5290&isbn=&volume=26&issue=4&spage=194&pages=194-215&date=2009&title=Contemporary+Hypnosis&atitle=Plasticity+changes+in+the+brain+in+hypnosis+and+meditation.&aulast=Halsband&pid=%3Cauthor%3EHalsband%2C+Ulrike%3BMueller%2C+Susanne%3BHinterberger%2C+Thilo%3BStrickner%2C+Simon%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2009-24534-003%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EJournal+Article%3C%2FDT%3E
